							<p class="mt-6 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.7] text-slate-400">
								AADM is one way to do that. It is a standard and a context service — deliberately not an enforcement
								product. Being clear about that boundary is the only way the rest of it stays credible.
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5">
							<div class="border-l-2 border-amber-300/40 pl-6">
								<p class="font-mono-cta text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-amber-200/85">
									What AADM deliberately does not do
								</p>
								<ul class="mt-6 divide-y divide-white/[0.06] border-t border-white/[0.06]">
									{
										[
											"Run your business logic or mutate your database.",
											"Scan your repository and hand out pass / fail verdicts.",
											"Issue compliance certificates or legal verdicts.",
											"Replace code review, CI, or server-side authorization.",
											"Make the engineering judgment for you.",
										].map((item, idx) => (
											<li class="group grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-baseline gap-4 py-4">
												<span class="font-mono-cta text-[11px] text-amber-300/80">
													{String(idx + 1).padStart(2, "0")}
												</span>
												<span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300 transition group-hover:text-white">
													{item}
												</span>
											</li>
										))
									}
								</ul>
								<p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
									Your production authorization, gateways, tests, and CI stay authoritative. The last line on that list is
									not a limitation to be engineered away — it is the job description.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- =============================================================
		     §11 — Where to go next
		     ============================================================= -->
		<section class="relative bg-surface-deep">
			<div
				aria-hidden="true"
				class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,rgba(110,231,183,0.08),transparent_60%)]"
			>
			</div>
			<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 px-4 py-28 sm:px-8 sm:py-40">
				<aside
					class="col-span-12 mb-8 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-4 sm:col-span-2 sm:mb-0 sm:flex-col sm:items-start sm:justify-start sm:gap-3 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:border-white/[0.08] sm:pb-0 sm:pr-4"
				>
					<span class="font-mono-cta text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-emerald-200/70">§ 11</span>
					<span class="font-mono-cta text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-slate-500">Where next</span>
				</aside>

				<div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-10">
					<p class="font-mono-cta text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-slate-500">
						<span class="text-emerald-200/90">▸</span> Six directions
					</p>
					<h2
						class="font-display mt-6 max-w-[15ch] text-balance text-[clamp(2.4rem,6.8vw,6rem)] font-black leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.04em] text-white"
					>
						Encode the<br />
						judgment
						<span class="relative inline-block">
							<span class="relative z-10 text-emerald-300">once.</span>
							<span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-[0.08em] -z-0 h-[0.18em] bg-emerald-300/30"></span>
						</span>
					</h2>
					<p class="mt-10 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
						The standard is free to read and lives in public. The hosted MCP exists so the same text reaches every agent,
						every session, without anyone maintaining a fork.
					</p>

					<div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-px bg-white/[0.08] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
						{
							nextSteps.map((step) => (
								<a
									href={step.href}
									class="group bg-surface-deep p-7 transition duration-300 hover:bg-[#0a0e1a] sm:p-8"
								>
									<div class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
										<span class="font-display text-[3rem] font-extralight leading-[0.85] text-emerald-200/80 transition duration-300 group-hover:text-emerald-300">
											{step.letter}
										</span>
										<h3 class="font-display text-[1.05rem] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white">
											{step.label}
											{step.external ? (
												<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1 text-slate-500">
													↗
												</span>
											) : null}
										</h3>
									</div>
									<p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">{step.body}</p>
									<div
										aria-hidden="true"
										class="mt-7 h-px w-10 bg-emerald-300/40 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-20 group-hover:bg-emerald-300/70"
									/>
								</a>
							))
						}
					</div>

					<div class="mt-16 flex flex-col flex-wrap items-start gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-5">
						<a
							href={urlMcpMarketing}
							class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white px-8 py-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 outline-none transition duration-200 hover:bg-emerald-200 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-300 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-deep"
						>
							<span>Connect production agents</span>
							<svg
								width="16"
								height="10"
								viewBox="0 0 16 10"
								fill="none"
								aria-hidden="true"
								class="transition duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
							>
								<path d="M1 5h13M10 1l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="square"></path>
							</svg>
						</a>
						<a
							href="/case-studies"
							class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/20 bg-transparent px-8 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white outline-none transition duration-200 hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-white/[0.04] focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/40 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-deep"
						>
							See it in a session
						</a>
					</div>

					<!-- Colophon -->
					<div
						class="mt-24 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 border-t border-white/[0.06] pt-8 font-mono-cta text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-600"
					>
						<div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-4">
							<span class="text-slate-500">Essay</span> · Agentic engineering v1
						</div>
						<div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-4">
							<span class="text-slate-500">For</span> · Engineers with twenty years of judgment
						</div>
						<div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-4">
							<span class="text-slate-500">Layer map</span> ·
							<span class="text-emerald-300/80">UDALI L1–L22</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
